Subject: [PATCH 7/7] GB_PRESS scripted input for recordings; docs for the new
 systems

input::scripted presses F X G L H B W S A D at given game seconds (with
optional holds) after the real input, so GB_RECORD can film interactions
headless. HANDOFF.md / handoff.json list hand, bvh, doors, sheath,
block, grab and repertoire with their ownership; the controls hint
shows X and G; LICENSES.md no longer claims terms it does not record.

